# Canonical identity for `git log`, `git shortlog` and anything that counts authors.
#
# Display only: a .mailmap says "these names are the same person". It maps the commits
# that were made before this repository's git identity was configured.
#
# Note that GitHub does not read .mailmap - it links commits to accounts by the commit
# e-mail address - so the web UI still shows the original address on those commits.
